reallife_meta_resetdata_explain:
This makes the save as if the mod had just been added to it, and keeps the mod running:

- everything the mod has going is ended (accidents and other incidents, jobs, the mod's people and things on the street);
- its moods are taken off;
- its stored data is removed: which life events you have seen, illness, fines owed, job and career progress, your driving licence, your record and court cases, the people you know, custom shop work, and the clothes picked for this save (the picks on the options page stay).

Phone contacts and their messages stay. A backup of the save file is made first (if that fails, nothing is done). The save file itself is not changed until you save.

